flowchart TD
    A[Long-context attention bottleneck] --> B[Prefill]
    A --> C[Decode]

    B --> D[LServe prefill]
    B --> E[SampleAttention]

    D --> D1[Unified block-sparse attention]
    D --> D2[Half the heads become streaming heads]
    D --> D3[Skip low-value KV blocks]

    E --> E1[Query-guided chunked sampling]
    E --> E2[Column pattern]
    E --> E3[Slash pattern]
    E --> E4[CRA threshold]

    E2 --> E21[Global anchors / attention sinks]
    E3 --> E31[Local continuity / recent context]
    E4 --> E41[Keep enough attention mass for worst query]

    C --> F[LServe decode]
    F --> F1[Hierarchical KV page selection]
    F --> F2[Reuse selected pages across nearby tokens]
    F --> F3[Combine sparsity with KV quantization]

